=== the build step stops on bad documents ===
  ok    an item naming a question the bank does not have stops the build and says so
  ok    a document of an unknown type stops the build and says so
  ok    a problem set CHAINS does not have stops the build and says so
  ok    a question on two documents stops the build and says so
  ok    an option holding a lookbehind stops the build and says so
  ok    a SOURCE_OF that disagrees with the documents' items stops the build and says so

